---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About D. Philhower Studio — a practice of clarity, heritage, and spatial rhythm for brand and family identity."
  path="/about"
  headerTheme="dark"
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="brand-line">D. Philhower Studio</p>
    <div class="deco-steps" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <h1>A studio for names held with care.</h1>
    <p>
      We design brand systems and websites for families and makers who want their presence to feel as true
      as the craft behind it.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="section prose-block reveal" aria-labelledby="story-title">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">The practice</p>
      <div class="deco-steps" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="story-title">Devotion over display.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        D. Philhower Studio specializes in custom brand creation, corporate identity for family businesses,
        and website design. The work is shaped by a design system we call Clarity, Heritage & Spatial Rhythm —
        Swedish honesty, Japanese pause, Deco verticality, and typographic boldness in service of story.
      </p>
      <p>
        We speak the way a workshop keeps its tools: with quiet confidence, with room to breathe, and with
        sincerity that does not need to perform.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal" aria-labelledby="values-title">
    <p class="section-label">How we show up</p>
    <div class="deco-steps" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="values-title">Principles we keep returning to.</h2>
    <ul class="values">
      <li>
        <h3>Clarity first</h3>
        <p>If it doesn’t tell the truth, it doesn’t ship. Hierarchy and honesty lead.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Space as meaning</h3>
        <p>What we leave open gives the mark — and the family story — their weight.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Continuity over costume</h3>
        <p>Identity evolves without abandoning the devotion that earned trust.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal" aria-label="Studio focus">
    <ul class="stat-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Brand + web</strong>
        <span>One language across identity and site — the two surfaces people meet you first.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Family corporate identity</strong>
        <span>Heritage treated as strategy. Systems built for the next steward of the name.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Living system</strong>
        <span>Clarity, heritage, and spatial rhythm — applied with care, documented for longevity.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-strip reveal" aria-labelledby="about-cta">
    <div class="contact-strip-inner">
      <h2 id="about-cta">Let’s shape something lasting.</h2>
      <p>Share a little of where the story has been — we’ll listen for what comes next.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Begin a conversation</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/system">Read the system</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
